{"unit_id":"zhou914485__dsh-recall#card-zh","repo":"zhou914485/dsh-recall","commit":"8f70ec22397c0a91d308ac33ab3e18dceadcb1c2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-recall 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话消息撤回插件。它在 Host 注册会话 RPC 通道，并在浏览器消息操作栏和输入框工具行加入撤回入口。用户可以撤回一条已发送消息或排队消息，让模型可见的对话从目标消息处折叠，并把原文放回输入框；界面提供撤回状态提示和原文复制。撤回前会展示涉及的回合、文件改动和工具调用，并可按记录恢复文件。回合结束时撤回会暂存到下一步再写入日志。插件通过 DSH bundle 安装，不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:59-71","index.js:578-670","client.js:208-269","client.js:667-714"]}
{"unit_id":"zhou914485__dsh-recall#card-en","repo":"zhou914485/dsh-recall","commit":"8f70ec22397c0a91d308ac33ab3e18dceadcb1c2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-recall adds message recall to DSH web. Users can recall sent or queued messages, hide affected conversation context, and restore its text to the composer. The Host previews affected turns and file changes; recorded diffs can restore files. Boundary recalls wait for the next step.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:59-71","index.js:578-670","client.js:208-269","client.js:667-714"]}
